# ── models/ — weights out, characterization in ──────────────────────
#
# `models/` was previously ignored wholesale because it holds ~820MB of
# TTS weights. That also excluded the model dossiers, which are corpus
# artifacts: CLAUDE.md cites them as canonical, EXECUTION-AUTHORITY-MODEL
# Phase 5 depends on them, and zp-regent's routing corpus loads them at
# runtime to score candidates. Nothing under models/ had ever been
# tracked, so a clean clone had an empty dossier corpus and every routing
# decision fell through to route_from_config.
#
# Exclude the weights by location and by extension; keep the
# characterization. Extension patterns catch a future model family that
# drops weights in a directory not named here.
models/kokoro/
models/piper/
models/**/*.onnx
models/**/*.bin
models/**/*.gguf
models/**/*.safetensors
models/**/*.pt
models/**/*.pth
models/**/.DS_Store
